SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:PNM Movie Night
LOCATION: WPU Assembly Room
URL:https://experience.pitt.edu/rsvp?id=389661
DESCRIPTION:Join us on December 4th at 9 PM for a good old-fashioned movie night! We’ll have popcorn and light snacks ready for you. Bring your favorite blanket and pillow — we’ll be spreading out on the freshly cleaned floor instead of using chairs for that comfy, cozy feel.\n---\nEvent Details: https://experience.pitt.edu/rsvp?id=389661
END:VEVENT
